# 🎬 Telugu Movie Sentiment Analysis using Naive Bayes

A complete NLP project that classifies Telugu movies as **HIT (positive)** or **FLOP (negative)**
using **tokenization**, **TF-IDF vectorization**, and a **Multinomial Naive Bayes** classifier.

## 📂 Project Structure



## ⚙️ Setup

```bash
# 1. Create and activate an isolated environment (macOS/Linux)
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate

# 2. Install dependencies
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt

# 3. Generate the dataset
python src/generate_dataset.py

# 4. Train the Naive Bayes model
python3 src/train_model.py

# 5. Test from the CLI
python src/predict.py Bahubali
python src/predict.py Radhe Shyam

# 6. Launch the Streamlit prompt-box UI
streamlit run app.py
```

If scikit-learn fails to import SciPy, use this isolated environment instead of
the global Python installation. The SciPy dependency is constrained to the
1.15 series, which supports Python 3.10.
